# NestJS API (`apps/api`)

- Organize features as Nest modules (controllers, services, DTOs)
- Validate inputs with DTOs / class-validator (or project equivalent)
- **Prisma only here** — schema, client, and migrations stay in `apps/api`
- Auth: **portal-scoped** httpOnly cookies + JWT (`numee_candidate_session` / `numee_recruiter_session` / `numee_admin_session`). Use `setPortalSessionCookie` / `clearPortalSessionCookie`; clear legacy `session` on login/logout.
- `SessionGuard` picks the cookie from the request path (`/api/admin/*`, `/api/recruiter/*`, else candidate)
- Protect admin routes: `ADMIN` guards on `/api/admin/*`; admin login is `POST /api/admin/auth/login` (not candidate auth)
- Frontends call this API; do not put business API logic in Next Route Handlers
